        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 He Khristianle, nang thouc katumcna taanc tho,",
            "Kandihmei khou gaanhmei chamv dinclou khang;",
            "Zaatc kaguay ta Damcloumeipu Ravguangc @<4",
            "Meic gaanv khat na sic ’maanmei kahaw mak.",
            "",
            "Gaychamv dinc ’dauh o, chuzaenghmei chamv;",
            "Jisu tuang thuakloumei, tiiduakloumei chamv 4^&.",
            "",
            "2 Zauc lo, maansei aching ching ’taw nganv bam e,",
            "Zinghmei kangkai khou paapc @<4 bangclouna;",
            "Guloumei pu chamv raclou nimei maekna,",
            "Kaniw khang theicloumei chamv chu tow mak.",
            "",
            "3 Zaatc kathuic khou, lat kathuic, kandih thuic khou,",
            "Ravguangc ramzian chamv hei dinc liklou tio;",
            "Kabaansyam ta gulou khang Kamei keyna,",
            "Theiclouna tingkauh kaikhamv laancloumei.",
            "",
            "4 Gaychamv dinh khang nang nah nunc ta tiipat ro,",
            "Nang tuang syanlanv tiipatna thouclou o;",
            "Huayneylou o, kaniw taanv khou rih ngam khang;",
            "Hei guay 4^& Pou @<4 khangclou dat puni."
          ]
        }
      },
